  UoG Model Secondary School - Official Web Portal & Results System

An all-in-one official website and student result checker portal designed and developed for University of Gondar Model Secondary School (UoGMSS).

Features

Official School Homepage: Displays school announcements, news, history, and contact details.
Student Result Portal: Allows students to view their academic performance and report cards efficiently.
User Authentication: Secure login for students and staff to access dashboard features.
Responsive Design: Optimized for seamless viewing on mobile phones, tablets, and desktop devices.


Tech Stack

Frontend: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript
Backend & Auth: Firebase (Authentication & Database)
Styling/UI: Custom CSS / Flexbox / Grid

--- 

Getting Started

Follow these instructions to run the project locally on your machine.

Prerequisites

You only need a modern web browser (Google Chrome, Firefox, Edge, or Safari).

Installation

1. Clone the repository
   ```bash
   git clone [https://github.com/dagimfkadie/uogmss-official.github.io.git](https://github.com/dagimfkadie/uogmss-official.github.io.git)
